    "within": "Q1 recognises triangles in less familiar orientations. Q2 names a tall rotated cuboid. Q3 matches flat shapes in different orientations. Q4 selects all rectangles including a square. Q5 names a triangular-based pyramid. Q6 relates a ball to a sphere. Q7 selects cuboids including a cube. Q8 matches a pyramid, sphere and cuboid. Q9 matches a triangle across size and colour. Q10 distinguishes two spheres from a flat circle and a cube. No hints.",
    "versus": "Easy recognises familiar flat shapes and solids, with hints on the first three. Medium varies size, orientation and proportions, including right-angled and scalene triangles and triangular-based pyramids. Hard mixes flat and solid shapes, recognises squares as rectangles and cubes as cuboids, and ignores colour and size. No spelling, face-counting or turn calculations."
